desc:
3D / Digital Twin / AR Developer – Existing Automotive Platform
I are looking for an experienced 3D, Digital Twin, WebGL/AR or computer-vision developer to implement a clearly defined 3D capability within an existing automotive technology platform.
This is not a greenfield project.
The wider system architecture, digital-twin concepts, component identity model, interfaces, schemas, test requirements and integration boundaries already exist.
I am looking for someone who already knows this area and can efficiently implement the supplied SP-06 High-Fidelity 3D, Scanning and AR Capability work package.
Initial Assignment
The Upwork engagement is focused on a bounded / proof-of-capability for one supplied vehicle or use case.
The implementation should demonstrate the core technical pipeline required for the wider SP-06 capability.
Depending on the supplied assets and agreed implementation approach, the work will include relevant elements of:
•	importing and processing a supplied 3D vehicle asset;
•	preserving the supplied vehicle/component hierarchy and component IDs;
•	converting/optimising geometry for interactive rendering;
•	GLB/glTF or equivalent production-friendly asset handling;
•	component-level selection and interaction;
•	exploded/reassembled vehicle views;
•	component highlighting/isolation;
•	metadata association with individual components;
•	Level of Detail (LOD) / geometry optimisation where appropriate;
•	efficient asset loading and rendering;
•	basic scan/geometry
